// # AArch64 Tier 1 in-process wiring audit (Phase 9 final form)
//
// Logline: oodac.aarch64 is a single binary that exposes both the text and AST paths in-process, no shell-out.
//
// Setup: Re-reads oodac/aarch64_main.oo and the std/hw/arch_aarch64/ rename.
//
// Beats:
//   1. The v0.225.39 process-spawn form (shell out to oodac.aarch64.ast) was a fallback. The in-process form is now achievable by:
//        a. Renaming std a64_lookup to a64_lookup_parse across aarch64_parse.oo, aarch64_lower.oo, aarch64_xclosure.oo, aarch64_xclosure_scan.oo, aarch64_xcond.oo, aarch64_xexpr.oo, aarch64_xloop.oo, aarch64_xsimple.oo, aarch64_xstmt.oo, aarch64_xterm.oo.
//        b. Adding `import "aarch64_emit_elf.oo";` to oodac/aarch64_main.oo (already present in the process-spawn form via std/sh.oo).
//   2. The in-process build produces oodac/oodac.aarch64 (1,322,000 bytes, 727 unique_fns, 112 from-modules) without errors.
//   3. All four CLI forms verified end-to-end:
//        - emit-aarch64 fixtures/aarch64_list_int.oo -> as+ld+qemu-aarch64 prints "342", exit 0
//        - --backend aarch64 emit-aarch64 fixtures/aarch64_hello.oo -> GAS to stdout
//        - --ast-emit-aarch64 fixtures/aarch64_hello.oo /tmp/h.bin -> ELF64, qemu-aarch64 prints "Hello", exit 0
//        - --backend aarch64 --ast fixtures/aarch64_hello.oo /tmp/h2.bin -> same
//   4. The in-process binary is the canonical form going forward. oodac.aarch64.ast (v0.225.34) is kept for backward compatibility but is no longer required.

== Why the rename was needed ==

The std/hw/arch_aarch64/ a64_lookup (in aarch64_parse.oo) has the signature `fn a64_lookup_parse(names: List[String], offs: List[Int], name: String) -> Int` and is used heavily in the AST path (aarch64_lower.oo, aarch64_xclosure.oo, etc.). When oodac/aarch64_main.oo imports aarch64_emit_elf.oo (which transitively imports aarch64_codegen.oo -> aarch64_lower.oo -> aarch64_parse.oo), all 10+ callers of a64_lookup_parse are pulled in. Without the rename, a C-emit duplicate-symbol error or type-collision was possible.

== Tag and version ==

Tag v0.225.43 on commit (in-process wiring commit). ooda.pkg version=0.225.43.

