* Phase 2: v0.225.32 List[T] (proven)
* Phase 3: v0.225.33 shape_refuse gate (proven)
* Phase 5: v0.225.34 AST-path runtime (proven, AST binary now redundant but kept)
* Phase 6: v0.225.35 AAPCS64 multi-fn (proven)
* Phase 7: v0.225.40 cross-arch + x86 cvttsd2si fix (proven)
* Phase 8: v0.225.41 3-arm match, v0.225.42 IDENT-body match (proven)
* Phase 9: v0.225.43 in-process Tier 1 wiring (proven, no shell-out)
